@title: login_unknown_user
@context: Names that are not accounts are refused, and a password belongs to its own account.
@tags: login
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the login page
    NAVIGATE to 'Login'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 2: A name that is not an account
    FILL 'Username' field with 'alan'
    FILL 'Password' field with 'turing'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present

STEP 3: Another one
    FILL 'Username' field with 'manul'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present
    VERIFY that 'Welcome' is NOT present

STEP 4: Another account's password
    FILL 'Username' field with 'grace'
    FILL 'Password' field with 'lovelace'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Invalid username or password' is present

STEP 5: Her own password
    FILL 'Password' field with 'hopper'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, grace' is present
    VERIFY 'Role' field has value 'member'

STEP 6: Sign out
    CLICK the 'Logout' button
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 7: Go home
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

DONE.
